     A                                  1 22'EDI LOG FILE REVIEW/PROCESS'
     A                                  1 75'SEDI'
     A                                  5  7'1)   PROCESS THE ENTIRE FILE'
     A                                  5 42'(THIS BYPASSES THE REVIEW SCREEN -
     A                                      AND'
     A                                  6 43'STARTS A JOB TO DO THE PROCESSIN-
     A                                      G)'
     A                                  8  7'2)   REVIEW/PROCESS SPECIFIC'
     A                                  9 12'ENTRIES OR ALL ENTRIES'
     A                                 13  4'1) TO PROCESS ALL ENTRIES IN THE E-
     A                                      DI LOG FILE WITHOUT REVIEWING, '
     A                                 14  7'PLACE AN "X" IN BOX 1 AND PRESS TH-
     A                                      E "ENTER" KEY'
     A                                 15  4'2) TO REVIEW/PROCESS ALL ENTRIES I-
     A                                      N THE EDI LOG FILE FOR A SPECIFIC V-
     A                                      ENDOR,'
     A                                 16  7'KEY THE VENDOR CODE IN BOX 2 AND P-
     A                                      RESS THE "ENTER" KEY'
     A                                 17  4'3) TO REVIEW/PROCESS THE ENTIRE ED-
     A                                      I LOG FILE, KEY IN THE WORD "ALL" I-
     A                                      N BOX 2'
     A                                 18  7'AND PRESS THE "ENTER" KEY'
     A                                 19  4'4) PRESS "f3" TO END THE PROGRAM.'
     A            COM            3A  B  1  2DSPATR(PR)
     A                                      OVRDTA
     A            X1             1A  B  5 37DSPATR(UL)
     A                                      OVRDTA
     A                                      OVRATR
     A                                      VALUES(' ' 'X')
     A  02                                  DSPATR(RI)
     A  02                                  DSPATR(PC)
     A            X2            10A  B  8 37DSPATR(UL)
     A                                      OVRDTA
     A                                      OVRATR
     A  03                                  DSPATR(RI)
     A  03                                  DSPATR(PC)
