     A                                  1 14'EDI LOG FILE PURCHASE ORDER REVIEW-
     A                                      /PROCESS'
     A                                  1 75'SEDI'
     A                                  3  4'THE FOLLOWING OPTIONS ARE AVAILABL-
     A                                      E WHEN ROCESSING THE EDI LOG FILE:'
     A                                  5  1'1)  ALL ENTRIES IN THE LOG FILE CA-
     A                                      N BE PROCESSED BY PLACING AN "X" '
     A                                  6  5'IN THE APPROPRIATE POSITION OF THE-
     A                                       INITIAL SCREEN. ALL ENTRIES CAN '
     A                                  7  5'ALSO BE PROCESSED BY PLACING AN "X-
     A                                      " IN THE PROCESS THE ENTIRE FILE '
     A                                  8  5'POSITION OF THE 2ND SCREEN; HOWEVE-
     A                                      R, IF YOU HAVE SELECTED A SPECIFIC'
     A                                  9  5'VENDOR ON THE INITIAL SCREEN FOR R-
     A                                      EVIEW, PLACING AN "X" IN THE '
     A                                 10  5'PROCESS THE ENTIRE FILE POSITION W-
     A                                      ILL PROCESS ALL THE ENTRIES IN THE '
     A                                 11  5'LOG FILE FOR THAT VENDOR ONLY.'
     A                                 12  1'2)  PROCESS THE LOG FILE FOR SELEC-
     A                                      TED PURCHASE ORDERS - THE REMAINDER'
     A                                 13  5'OF THE ENTRIES THAT DO NOT CORRESP-
     A                                      OND TO THE SELECTED ORDERS ENTERED'
     A                                 14  5'WILL REMAIN IN THE LOG FILE. THE M-
     A                                      AXIMUM NUMBER OF PURCHASE ORDERS'
     A                                 15  5'THAT CAN BE SELECTED IS EIG-
     A                                      HT (8).'
     A                                 16  1'3)  PROCESS THE ENTIRE LOG FILE'
     A                                 16 33'EXCEPT FOR A SELECTED NUMBER OF PU-
     A                                      RCHASE'
     A                                 17  5'ORDERS. THE ENTRIES THAT CORRESPON-
     A                                      D TO THE SELECTED ORDERS WILL REMAI-
     A                                      N'
     A                                 18  5'IN THE LOG FILE, THE REMAINDER OF -
     A                                      ENTRIES WILL BE PROCESSED. THE MAXI-
     A                                      MUM'
     A                                 19  5'NUMBER OF PURCHASE ORDERS THAT'
     A                                 19 36'CAN BE SELECTED IS EIGHT (8).'
     A                                 20  1'4)  IF NO PROCESSING OPTION IS DES-
     A                                      IRED AND YOU WISH TO ONLY REVIEW TH-
     A                                      E LOG'
     A                                 21  5'FILE THEN PRESS "f3" WHEN YOU ARE'
     A                                 21 39'DONE TO RETURN TO THE FIRST SCREEN-
     A                                      .'
     A                                 22  5'NO PROCESSING WILL BE DONE.'
     A                                 23  1'PRESS "F3" TO RETURN TO PREVIOUS S-
     A                                      CREEN'
     A            COM            3A  B  1  2DSPATR(PR)
     A                                      OVRDTA
     A            COMMANDLN1    79A  B 24  1DFTVAL('                           -
     A                                                                         -
     A                                                       ')
     A                                      DSPATR(PR)
     A  98                                  OVRDTA
